  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tailor-made training alumni Water Management 2020, Iraq &amp; Iran</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The tailor-made training (TMT) will increase the alumni&apos;s knowledge in the field of water management. This knowledge will enable them to (better) guide reforms/developments in the field of water management in their own country (change agent). In addition, the aim of the event is to strengthen the ties of the alumni of the Shiraka Training Programme (STP)  training course water management 2020, TMT Iraq and TMT Iran with the Netherlands (ambassador to the Netherlands).</narrative>
  </description>
